SUMMARY:December Book Club: Beautyland
DESCRIPTION:A book club for adults who want to read in community. We meet 
 one Friday morning a month to chat about a title we read in 
 common.\n\n--\n\nBEAUTYLAND\nby Marie-Helene Bertino (2024)\n\nAt the 
 moment when Voyager 1 is launched into space\, a baby of unusual perception 
 is born to a single mother in Philly in this gorgeously original 
 coming-of-age novel about a woman who doesn't feel at home on 
 Earth.\n\nCopies will be available at the Circulation Desk starting 
 November 20. \n\n
LOCATION:Literacy Room\, West Orange Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="West Orange Library":MAILTO:events@westorange.bccls.org
