 month. Bag lunch provided by Toni's Kitchen.\n\n***\n\nSense and 
 Sensibility (2026)\nPG\, 2h 13m\n\nFeaturing: Daisy Edgar-Jones\, Esmé 
 Creed-Miles\, Caitríona Balfe \nDirected by: Georgia Oakley\n\nSisters 
 Elinor and Marianne Dashwood must leave their Sussex estate to live with a 
 distant relative\, while facing both romantic and financial struggles. 
 --IMDB\n\nBased on the classic novel by Jane Austen.
