SUMMARY:SCORE Business Mentoring
DESCRIPTION:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n5 Steps for Mentoring\n\n\n\n\nFollow five simple 
 steps to connect with a SCORE mentor and move your business forward with 
 expert 
 guidance.\n\nhttps://www.score.org/how-mentoring-works/\n\n\n\n\n\nThe 
 Service Corps of Retired Executives\, now known as SCORE\, offers 
 entrepreneurs free\, confidential drop in business mentoring. SCORE mentors 
 are experts in entrepreneurship and business operations who volunteer their 
 time to share their expertise with small business clients. Whether you’re 
 starting a business\, growing an existing company\, or planning your next 
 move\, SCORE provides the guidance and tools to help you 
 succeed.\n\nhttps://www.score.org/nj/metro-nj/\n
