BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20271110T150000Z
DTEND:20271110T180000Z
DTSTAMP:20271110T000000Z
SUMMARY:SCORE Business Mentoring
DESCRIPTION:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n5 Steps for Mentoring\n\n\n\n\nFollow five simple 
 steps to connect with a SCORE mentor and move your business forward with 
 expert 
 guidance.\n\nhttps://www.score.org/how-mentoring-works/\n\n\n\n\n\nThe 
 Service Corps of Retired Executives\, now known as SCORE\, offers 
 entrepreneurs free\, confidential drop in business mentoring. SCORE mentors 
 are experts in entrepreneurship and business operations who volunteer their 
 time to share their expertise with small business clients. Whether you’re 
 starting a business\, growing an existing company\, or planning your next 
 move\, SCORE provides the guidance and tools to help you 
 succeed.\n\nhttps://www.score.org/nj/metro-nj/\n
LOCATION:West Orange - Computer Lab
ORGANIZER;CN="West Orange Library":MAILTO:events@westorange.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:
UID:LibCal-10341-17931765
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17931765
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20271110T180000Z
DTEND:20271110T190000Z
DTSTAMP:20271110T000000Z
SUMMARY:English Conversation Class
DESCRIPTION:\n	Join this informal get-together for anyone who wants to 
 learn English\, improve their English or just listen to others enjoying 
 English conversation\n	Everyone is welcome\, regardless of their location\, 
 educational experience\, or background.\n	The conversation leader will help 
 everyone practice speaking in English through group social 
 interaction\n	Easy-to-read books in English will be introduced to improve 
 vocabulary and comprehension\n	Come for a friendly\, lively atmosphere and 
 get to know others who want to gain comfort with English 
 conversation.\n\n\nThis program will be held in the Literacy Room.
LOCATION:Literacy Room
ORGANIZER;CN="West Orange Library":MAILTO:events@westorange.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:ESL
UID:LibCal-10341-17318613
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17318613
END:VEVENT
